NrdmtCYkpSWmNHUUU2bWZDM0NuSHc?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"儘管第三季超出預期，SoundHound AI 股票 (SOUN) 仍下跌"},{"title":"SoundHound AI Q3 Earnings Today: Wall Street and Options Market’s Last-Minute Verdict on SOUN Stock","src":"TipRanks","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPWmkxOFB3T193M3k0VDBEWUpTMDl0WnBQOXVNVThyRlVRSTV4Rkdvb1BrZm84Vm5aRm1Nai1COEVMcEY2UWtKckV1Ny05QjJxc0M5cWtzc0lqaVZGRFBVbldUZXJzQlJvSGk5T0xIRWtLa0Zsb3N2akR4NVZUSGR3M1dXREZfRnBQYktJckRQX3ZOQmYxcDVEZHJMVVZ2R1otemRSUFg0bENpVTlYb201ZmlrenRRUXg0Nm5ndHJaNU1oNmdDUEE?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"SoundHound AI 今日第三季財報：華爾街與選擇權市場對 SOUN 股票的最後一刻判斷"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":17},{"name":"財報","count":11},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-02","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1840856/000184085626000006/soun-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"SoundHound's mission is to voice-enable the world with conversational intelligence through an independent AI platform enabling humans to interact with products and services like they interact with each other — by speaking naturally.","zh":"SoundHound 的使命是透過獨立的人工智慧平台，透過對話智慧為世界提供語音支持，使人類能夠透過自然語言與產品和服務進行交互，就像彼此互動一樣。"},{"en":"We are a global leader in conversational intelligence, offering independent Voice AI solutions that enable businesses to deliver high-quality conversational experiences to their customers. Built on proprietary technology, SoundHound's voice AI delivers best-in-class speed and accuracy in numerous languages to product creators across automotive, TV, and IoT, and to customer service industries via groundbreaking AI-driven products like Smart Answering, Smart Ordering, and Dynamic Interaction , and Employee Assist. Along with SoundHound Chat AI, a powerful voice assistant with integrated Generative AI, SoundHound powers millions of products and services, and processes billions of interactions each year for world class businesses.","zh":"我們是對話智慧領域的全球領導者，提供獨立的語音人工智慧解決方案，使企業能夠為其客戶提供高品質的對話體驗。 SoundHound 的語音 AI 基於專有技術，透過智慧應答、智慧訂購、動態互動和員工協助等突破性的 AI 驅動產品，以多種語言為汽車、電視和物聯網的產品創造者以及客戶服務行業提供一流的速度和準確性。與 SoundHound Chat AI（一款整合了生成式 AI 的強大語音助理）一起，SoundHound 為數百萬種產品和服務提供支持，每年為世界級企業處理數十億次互動。"},{"en":"We believe voice-enabled conversational user interface is a more natural interface for nearly all use cases, and product creators should have the ability to design, customize, differentiate, innovate and monetize the interface to their own product, as opposed to outsourcing it to a third-party assistant. For example, using SoundHound, businesses can voice-enable their products so consumers can say things like, \"Turn off the air conditioning and lower the windows,\" while in their cars, \"Find romantic comedies released in the last year,\" while streaming on their TV and even place food orders before arriving at a restaurant by talking to their cars, TVs or other IoT devices. Additionally, SoundHound's technology can address complex user queries such as, \"Show me all restaurants within half a mile of the Space Needle that are open past 9pm on Wednesdays and have outdoor seating,\" and follow-","zh":"我們認為，支援語音的會話使用者介面對於幾乎所有用例來說都是更自然的介面，產品創建者應該有能力為自己的產品設計、客製化、差異化、創新和貨幣化介面，而不是將其外包給第三方助理。例如，使用 SoundHound，企業可以為其產品啟用語音功能，這樣消費者就可以在車內說“關掉空調並降下車窗”，“查找去年上映的浪漫喜劇”，同時在電視上播放流媒體內容，甚至可以在到達餐廳之前通過與汽車、電視或其他物聯網設備通話來下訂單。此外，SoundHound 的技術可以解決複雜的用戶查詢，例如“顯示太空針塔半英里範圍內所有每週三晚上 9 點以上營業並設有戶外座位的餐廳”，然後-"}],"markets":[{"en":"SoundHound's momentum in the Voice AI market can, in large part, be attributed to our large number of technology breakthroughs.","zh":"SoundHound在語音AI市場的勢頭很大程度上可以歸功於我們大量的技術突破。"},{"en":"SoundHound's Voice AI platform combines advanced AI with engineering expertise to help brands build conversational voice assistants. From proprietary components to customizable and scalable solutions, we offer tools to build a highly accurate and responsive voice user interface.","zh":"SoundHound 的語音 AI 平台將先進的人工智慧與工程專業知識相結合，幫助品牌打造對話式語音助理。從專有組件到可自訂和可擴展的解決方案，我們提供建立高度準確且響應靈敏的語音使用者介面的工具。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We take an insight-driven, account-based marketing approach to build and expand our relationships with customers and partners. We collect feedback directly from them to garner insights that help drive the business and product. We also work with analysts and higher education institutions to conduct studies, test and validate technology performance, providing key proof points for those considering our products. In parallel, marketing and communications drive our brand equity and narrative through ongoing announcements, campaigns, events, speaking opportunities, and public relations efforts.","zh":"我們採用洞察驅動、以客戶為基礎的行銷方法來建立和擴大與客戶和合作夥伴的關係。我們直接從他們那裡收集回饋，以獲取有助於推動業務和產品發展的見解。我們也與分析師和高等教育機構合作進行研究、測試和驗證技術性能，為考慮我們產品的人提供關鍵證據。同時，行銷和傳播透過持續的公告、活動、活動、演講機會和公共關係工作來推動我們的品牌資產和敘事。"},{"en":"Our demand generation efforts span the full customer funnel to target prospects across a variety of channels including: advertising, email, social media, search engines and many other digital channels.","zh":"我們的需求產生工作涵蓋整個客戶管道，透過各種管道瞄準潛在客戶，包括：廣告、電子郵件、社群媒體、搜尋引擎和許多其他數位管道。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service Subscriptions","val":133547000,"zh":"服務訂閱"},{"name":"Hosted Services","val":108255000,"zh":"託管服務"},{"name":"Licensing","val":45146000,"zh":"授權"},{"name":"Product Royalties","val":34913000,"zh":"產品特許權使用費"},{"name":"Professional Service","val":15059000,"zh":"專業服務"},{"name":"Monetization","val":460000,"zh":"貨幣化"}],"total":168920000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":108387000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":42530000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"KR","val":10336000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"FR","val":7307000,"zh":"FR"},{"name":"DE","val":360000,"zh":"德國"}],"total":168920000}},"peers":["BBAI","RGTI","SMCI","QBTS","APLD"]}}